        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scotty Grainger Jr., Blair Redford, Daniel Hall\n- TV Shows: The Young and the Restless, Passions, The Lying Game, Switched at Birth, Satisfaction\n- Organizations: CBS, Soap Opera Digest\n- Roles: Scotty Grainger, Miguel Lopez-Fitzgerald, Ethan Whitehorse, Tyler \"Ty\" Mendoza, Simon Waverly\n\nFacts:\n- Scott \"Scotty\" Grainger Jr. is a fictional character from the CBS soap opera The Young and the Restless.\n- Blair Redford, born July 27, 1983, is an American actor.\n- Blair Redford played Scotty Grainger on The Young and the Restless from July 2005 until January 2006.\n- Blair Redford is also known for playing Miguel Lopez-Fitzgerald on Passions, Ethan Whitehorse on The Lying Game, Tyler \"Ty\" Mendoza on Switched at Birth, and Simon Waverly on Satisfaction.\n- In January 2017, Soap Opera Digest announced that Daniel Hall had been recast as Scotty Grainger on The Young and the Restless.",
